DESCRIPTION:🇨🇱 THE OPEN FONDA ‘26 — The Biggest Chilean Fonda on 
 the Gold Coast 📅 Sunday 20 September 2026 ⏰ 2:00 PM – 10:00 PM 📍
  Miami Marketta The Open Fonda takes over Miami Marketta for a full day fa
 mily-friendly Chilean celebration\, bringing together music\, food\, dance
  and culture in a vibrant community atmosphere — all in the heart of the
  Gold Coast. 🎶 Live Music & DJs 🎺 Live cumbia & dancefloor favourite
 s by Kachimbaz (Sydney) 🎸 Chilean rock & pop classics by Mr. Veneno (Br
 isbane) 🎧 Firing up the party: DJ Dabito (Gold Coast) & DJ Maria Pina (
 Sydney) 💃 Traditional Chilean Cueca performance by Danza Montun (Brisba
 ne) 🍴 Food & Drinks 🥟 A Chilean classics food feast — empanadas\, 
 choripán\, mote con huesillo and much more. 🍹 Sip and celebrate like a
 t home with piscolas\, terremotos\, Chilean wine and more. ❤️ Feeling 
 Chileno de Corazón? 💃 Sign up for our Cueca Contest \, show your moves
  and celebrate our traditions together. 🎨🎯 Dive into a full day of t
 raditional games\, arts & crafts for kids and plenty of fun for all ages. 
 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Bring the family\, come with friends\, enjoy gre
 at food\, dance all afternoon and let’s celebrate Chile together. 🎟
 ️ Limited tickets available ✨ Produced by Casa Babylon
